# ST2: e1m1's fluorescent corridor in real time, light style 10 flickering. Classic,
# 960x600 in its 4:3 box, id's 72 Hz ticks; cl.time 3.0 at file second 1. Brightness 0.7.
#
# Under V3-26: "The lights id did animate are strings of letters, from a for dark to zee
# for bright, a new letter every tenth of a second."

map e1m1
warmup until 2.0

duration 13.5
fps 60
size 1920x1080

preset classic
hud off
cvar gamma 0.7

camera fixed 600,140,110 0,300

sound on
events on
